---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import afkBg from '../assets/images/bg_afk.png';
---
<section class="section section-bg panel center" id="afk">
	<div class="bg">
        <Image src={afkBg} alt="" layout='full-width' width={800} height={600} />
	</div>
	<div class="inner">
		<h2>Away From Keyboard</h2>
		<div class="afk-text">
            <p>On my free time I can be found jammin’ Nintendo Switch, playing banjo or watching true crime shows. During the Summer I enjoy being outdoors with my wife and dog. I like to macrame, cross stitch, and knit. I build and play early fretless gourd banjos. Big fan of art, food and music. Known to sometimes sneak back to the keyboard.</p>
        </div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
    #afk {
        .bg {
            opacity: 0.25;
        }
    }
</style>